TITLE 1D transport, 10 cells, 10 shifts, cation exchange

SOLUTION 0 Infilling
    pH      7.0
    Na      1.0
    Cl      1.0

SOLUTION 1-10 Initial cells
    pH      7.0
    Ca      1.0
    Cl      2.0

EXCHANGE 1-10
    X 0.001
    -equilibrate 1

TRANSPORT
    -cells 10
    -shifts 10
    -flow_direction forward
    -boundary_conditions flux flux
    -lengths 1
    -dispersivities 0
    -correct_disp true
    -diffusion_coefficient 0

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -reset false
    -high_precision true
    -user_punch true

USER_PUNCH
    -headings step cell alk
10 PUNCH STEP_NO, CELL_NO, ALK

END
